                                                "example_id": "1b6efe08-fc88-43fa-ae75-fe031497d9ff",
                                                "sense_id": "44bb15ab-2a3e-3cf4-8139-f4e582d1fcf6",
                                                "text": "Of vvhat texte thou proveſt hell / vvill a nother prove purgatory / a nother lymbo patrum / and a nother the aſſumpcion of oure ladi: And a nother ſhall prove of the ſame texte that an Ape hath a tayle."
